        <xref ref="data-Russell2009-Possums"/> studied road-kill possums in the northern suburbs of Sydney (Table <xref ref="tab-possum-roadkill-number"/>).
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li><p>Identify the two variables, and classify them as nominal or ordinal.</p></li>
