    <exercise xml:id="exercise-skipping-breakfast">
      <p>
        The data in Table <xref ref="tab-skip-breakfast"/> come from a study of Iranian children aged <m>6</m><ndash/><m>18</m> years old <xref ref="data-kelishadi2017-snack"/>.
      </p>
